@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US017 - To create a private collection of publications

actor "User" as User
participant ":MiteLovers" as UI

User -> UI : I want to create a new private collection of publications
activate UI
UI --> User : What is the collection name?
deactivate UI

User -> UI : name("My Favorites")
activate UI
UI --> User : Here is the list of available genres, select one
deactivate UI

User -> UI : selectedGenre("Fiction")
activate UI
UI --> User : Private collection of publications created successfully
deactivate UI

@enduml
